        ],
        "text": "Oral argument for the case took place on Wednesday, November 13, 2002 at 11:04 a.m. before the Supreme Court of the United States."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justices",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0000-0005",
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0001-0000",
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "During the argument, Justices asked questions about the statute\u2019s effectiveness, possible badge requirements, and associated stigma."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice O'Connor asked Mr. Blumenthal whether the statute has helped reduce sex crimes in Connecticut."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked Mr. Olson whether Connecticut could require every person on the registry to wear a badge displaying the information posted online."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens also inquired about the stigma associated with such a badge."
      }
    ],
