            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Richard Blumenthal, the case concerns the public availability of accurate, true public record information about convicted sex offenders, which citizens of Connecticut and other states need to protect themselves and their families."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Richard Blumenthal",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Richard Blumenthal, petitioners argue that this information helps the public make choices about safety."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondents",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Respondents, respondents emphasize that the purpose of the law is to protect the public, especially children, from recidivist sex offenders."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Theodore B. Olson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 17,
              "start": 17
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Theodore B. Olson, amicus Theodore B. Olson notes that individuals on the registry are more likely than the general population to be dangerous."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Sadin",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "983b932d63a8d6477f235aef7623d8933bea9546c558aed2d93a52eea1edd531",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-983b932d63a8-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Sadin, the process involves posting individuals publicly before they register, indicating a procedural step prior to registration."
      }
    ],
